+          <div class="portrait-wrap"><span class="member-number">NO. 04</span><img class="portrait" src="{{image:Jenith_avatar.png}}" alt="Portrait of Jenith"></div>
+          <div class="card-content">
+            <h3 class="member-name">Jenith</h3>
+            <p class="study">M.Sc. Computer Science, Paderborn University</p>
+            <p class="mini-label">Current side quests</p><p class="interests">Cybersecurity, SOC ops, VAPT &amp; Python</p>
+            <p class="fun-fact">Once debugged a digital traffic jam. The culprit: one router rule.</p>
+            <p class="hot-take"><b>Hot take</b>AI gives humans peace of mind. Caution: only if they know how to use it.</p>
+          </div>
+        </article>
+
+        <article class="member-card">
+          <div class="portrait-wrap"><span class="member-number">NO. 05</span><img class="portrait" src="{{image:vatsal_avatar.jpeg}}" alt="Portrait of Vatsal"></div>
+          <div class="card-content">
+            <h3 class="member-name">Vatsal</h3>
+            <p class="study">M.Sc. Computer Science, Paderborn; B.E. Computer Engineering</p>
+            <p class="mini-label">Current side quests</p><p class="interests">AI, anime, volleyball, sightseeing &amp; dramas</p>
+            <p class="fun-fact">Reserved at first; then the thoughts arrive in director's-cut length.</p>
+            <p class="hot-take"><b>Hot take</b>AI makes building easy. Trusting the generated code? That's the real boss fight.</p>
+          </div>
+        </article>
+      </div>
